## What this licence does and does not cover

The MIT licence above applies to the **source code** of this repository. Take
it, learn from it, build your own club site on it.

It does **not** apply to the following, which are not the club's to give away
or are reserved:

### Embed Club brand assets - all rights reserved

The Embed Club name, logo, wordmark and banner remain the property of Embed
Club and may not be used to identify your project, imply endorsement, or
suggest that your site is the club's.

    public/embedClubLogo-Dark.svg
    public/embedClubLogo-Light.svg
    public/EmbedClubBanner-Dark.svg
    public/EmbedClubBanner-Light.svg
    public/favicon.ico
    public/icon192.png
    public/icon512.png
    public/appleTouchIcon.png
    src/app/icon.svg

Replace them with your own before publishing anything built on this code.

### P.A. College of Engineering marks

    public/pace-logo.png
    public/pacesilvioralogo.png

These belong to the institution, not to the club, and are included only so the
club's own site can display them.

### Fonts

Bundled typefaces keep their own licences and are not covered by the MIT grant:

- **TeX Gyre Adventor** (`public/texgyreadventor-*.otf`) - GUST Font License,
  free to use and redistribute.
- **Gobold** (`public/fonts/GoboldBold.otf`) and **Sport Break**
  (`public/fonts/SportBreakFreeVersion.otf`) - free versions, whose terms
  restrict commercial use. Check before using them in anything commercial.

### Site content

Text, photographs, member details, event records and other content published
through the CMS belong to Embed Club and the people in them. The demo dataset
produced by `pnpm seed:demo` is invented and carries no such restriction.
